WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.449
Choose Ibiza Sunset Strip, press start, and you are riding. The course now draws

00:00:07.449 --> 00:00:08.966
where the video was.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.265
There is no loading screen any more. Class Ride opens at once: the clock starts, and

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:20.094
the bike gets its first resistance, while the box says the course is loading.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:30.254
Nothing of the course is fetched before the ride. The renderer and three files come

00:00:30.254 --> 00:00:31.679
when you press start.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.102
Then the course takes the video's box. You are alone on the road, seen from behind,

00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:43.617
and no video player is loaded at all.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:55.885
If the course comes late, you are not put back on the start line. Here it came

00:00:55.885 --> 00:01:00.561
forty-five seconds in, and the rider was drawn three hundred metres up the road.

00:01:07.104 --> 00:01:11.974
World loading is removed, with Telo Ride's other worlds and their music. The build

00:01:11.974 --> 00:01:15.719
went from two hundred and fifteen megabytes to under five.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:25.593
The course in its box, from a phone to a desktop.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:38.188
The tests came first. Three failed, as expected, and one passed on the code carried

00:01:38.188 --> 00:01:43.208
over. Now three hundred and thirty-one specs and six hundred and one unit tests

00:01:43.208 --> 00:01:43.826
pass.

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:54.053
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:54.053 --> 00:01:55.249
nothing else.

00:01:55.594 --> 00:02:00.546
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:02:00.546 --> 00:02:05.558
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:09.059
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:02:09.405 --> 00:02:13.380
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
